  "scenario_title": "Outbreak: Blackwood High Incident (Alley to Docks)",
  "narrative_summary": "The survivors begin trapped in a claustrophobic alleyway behind Blackwood High School. After bypassing a crashed delivery truck and recovering a padlock key to enter via lower basement ventilation, they navigate through the infected main vestibule and classrooms. Gaining access to the science laboratory and principal's suite allows them to synthesize a chemical agent, solve security puzzles, and obtain the Master Keycard. Finally, they break out through the loading bay corridor into the docks yard, where they must reactivate the generator board and defend against a horde assault to reach the escape boat.",
